Safety section	Check the description against the implicated contracts	2026-09-30T15:45:48.7334012Z   PR_BODY: Implements explicit synchronous transaction handles from litedb-org/LiteDB#3064 and #3067, including the native-admission stack from #132. Targets **`dev` at `5dd942a73`** and its safety framework from litedb-org/LiteDB#3034/#3045.
